add(6,r'Let $P,Q$ be constants. If $\frac{9x+3}{(x+7)(x-8)}$\n\n$\equiv\frac P{x+7}+\frac Q{x-8}$, find $P,Q$.',r'設 $P,Q$ 為常數。若 $\frac{9x+3}{(x+7)(x-8)}$\n\n$\equiv\frac P{x+7}+\frac Q{x-8}$，求 $P,Q$。',r'Clear the common denominator on $x\ne-7,8$ to get $9x+3=P(x-8)+Q(x+7)$. This polynomial identity extends to all $x$. At $x=-7$, $-60=-15P$, so $P=4$. At $x=8$, $75=15Q$, so $Q=5$. Check: $4(x-8)+5(x+7)=9x+3$.',r'在 $x\ne-7,8$ 下同乘公分母，得 $9x+3=P(x-8)+Q(x+7)$。所得多項式恆等式對所有 $x$ 皆成立。代入 $-7$ 得 $-60=-15P$，故 $P=4$；代入 $8$ 得 $75=15Q$，故 $Q=5$。檢查：$4(x-8)+5(x+7)=9x+3$。','poly-partial-fractions','rational-expressions','medium','Clear denominators to a polynomial identity, then evaluate at each denominator root.',options=['$P=9,Q=3$','$P=3,Q=9$','$P=4,Q=5$','$P=5,Q=4$'],answer='C')
verify(6,4*(x-8)+5*(x+7),9*x+3,'partial fractions numerator identity')
rational(7,r'$\frac{2x^2+13x-7}{x^2+5x+6}$\n\n$\times\frac{24-6x^2}{8x^3-1}$\n\n$\times\frac{x+3}{3x+21}$',r'$\frac{2x^2+13x-7}{x^2+5x+6}$\n\n$\times\frac{24-6x^2}{8x^3-1}$\n\n$\times\frac{x+3}{3x+21}$',(2*x*x+13*x-7)/(x*x+5*x+6)*(24-6*x*x)/(8*x**3-1)*(x+3)/(3*x+21),2*(2-x)/(4*x*x+2*x+1),r'Factor the expressions as $(2x-1)(x+7)$, $(x+2)(x+3)$, $6(2-x)(x+2)$, $(2x-1)(4x^2+2x+1)$ and $3(x+7)$. Cancel common factors and reduce $6/3=2$.',r'各式依次分解為 $(2x-1)(x+7)$、$(x+2)(x+3)$、$6(2-x)(x+2)$、$(2x-1)(4x^2+2x+1)$ 及 $3(x+7)$。約去共同因式，並把 $6/3$ 化為 2。',r'$x\ne-2,-3,\frac12,-7$ (real variables)',r'$x\ne-2,-3,\frac12,-7$（實數變量）',page=2)
rational(8,r'$\frac{x^2+5x-6}{x^2+7x+12}$\n\n$\times\frac{x^2-2x-15}{x^2-2x-8}$\n\n$\div\frac{x^2+x-30}{x^2+6x+8}$',r'$\frac{x^2+5x-6}{x^2+7x+12}$\n\n$\times\frac{x^2-2x-15}{x^2-2x-8}$\n\n$\div\frac{x^2+x-30}{x^2+6x+8}$',(x*x+5*x-6)/(x*x+7*x+12)*(x*x-2*x-15)/(x*x-2*x-8)/((x*x+x-30)/(x*x+6*x+8)),(x-1)/(x-4),r'The three fractions factor as $(x+6)(x-1)/[(x+3)(x+4)]$, $(x-5)(x+3)/[(x-4)(x+2)]$ and $(x+6)(x-5)/[(x+2)(x+4)]$. Invert the third before cancellation; its numerator must remain nonzero.',r'三個分式分別分解為 $(x+6)(x-1)/[(x+3)(x+4)]$、$(x-5)(x+3)/[(x-4)(x+2)]$ 及 $(x+6)(x-5)/[(x+2)(x+4)]$。第三個分式先取倒數才約去因式，其原分子亦不可為零。',r'$x\ne-3,-4,4,-2,-6,5$',r'$x\ne-3,-4,4,-2,-6,5$',page=2)
rational(9,r'$\frac2{x^2+4x+3}-\frac1{x^2+5x+6}$',r'$\frac2{x^2+4x+3}-\frac1{x^2+5x+6}$',2/(x*x+4*x+3)-1/(x*x+5*x+6),1/((x+2)*(x+1)),r'Factor denominators as $(x+1)(x+3)$ and $(x+2)(x+3)$. The combined numerator is $2(x+2)-(x+1)=x+3$.',r'分母分解為 $(x+1)(x+3)$ 及 $(x+2)(x+3)$，通分後分子為 $2(x+2)-(x+1)=x+3$。',r'$x\ne-1,-2,-3$',r'$x\ne-1,-2,-3$',skill='poly-rational-sums',page=2)
rational(10,r'$\frac2{x^2-x-6}-\frac4{x^2-6x-16}$\n\n$+\frac3{x^2-11x+24}$',r'$\frac2{x^2-x-6}-\frac4{x^2-6x-16}$\n\n$+\frac3{x^2-11x+24}$',2/(x*x-x-6)-4/(x*x-6*x-16)+3/(x*x-11*x+24),1/((x-3)*(x-8)),r'The denominators are $(x-3)(x+2)$, $(x-8)(x+2)$ and $(x-3)(x-8)$. Over their common denominator the numerator is $2(x-8)-4(x-3)+3(x+2)=x+2$.',r'分母為 $(x-3)(x+2)$、$(x-8)(x+2)$、$(x-3)(x-8)$。通分後分子為 $2(x-8)-4(x-3)+3(x+2)=x+2$。',r'$x\ne3,-2,8$',r'$x\ne3,-2,8$',skill='poly-rational-sums',page=2)
rational(11,r'$\frac1{x-2}$\n\n$-\frac{2x^2-17x+30}{2x^2+3x-20}$\n\n$\div\frac{8x^2-49x+6}{5x+20}$',r'$\frac1{x-2}$\n\n$-\frac{2x^2-17x+30}{2x^2+3x-20}$\n\n$\div\frac{8x^2-49x+6}{5x+20}$',1/(x-2)-(2*x*x-17*x+30)/(2*x*x+3*x-20)/((8*x*x-49*x+6)/(5*x+20)),3*(x+3)/((x-2)*(8*x-1)),r'The second term is a quotient: factor its parts as $(2x-5)(x-6)$, $(2x-5)(x+4)$, $(8x-1)(x-6)$ and $5(x+4)$. The quotient becomes $5/(8x-1)$. Now subtract from $1/(x-2)$; the new numerator is $(8x-1)-5(x-2)=3(x+3)$.',r'第二項含除法，相關因式分別為 $(2x-5)(x-6)$、$(2x-5)(x+4)$、$(8x-1)(x-6)$、$5(x+4)$，相除後得 $5/(8x-1)$。再從 $1/(x-2)$ 減去它，通分分子為 $(8x-1)-5(x-2)=3(x+3)$。',r'$x\ne2,\frac52,-4,\frac18,6$',r'$x\ne2,\frac52,-4,\frac18,6$',skill='poly-rational-sums',difficulty='hard',page=2)
rational(12,r'$\frac{1-\frac yx}{\frac xy-\frac yx}$',r'$\frac{1-\frac yx}{\frac xy-\frac yx}$',(1-y/x)/(x/y-y/x),y/(x+y),r'The numerator is $(x-y)/x$ and the denominator is $(x^2-y^2)/(xy)$. Multiply by the reciprocal and factor $x^2-y^2=(x-y)(x+y)$.',r'分子為 $(x-y)/x$，分母為 $(x^2-y^2)/(xy)$。乘以倒數，再分解 $x^2-y^2=(x-y)(x+y)$。',r'$x\ne0$, $y\ne0$, $x-y\ne0$, $x+y\ne0$',r'$x\ne0$、$y\ne0$、$x-y\ne0$、$x+y\ne0$',skill='poly-complex-fractions',page=2)
add(13,r'Let $A,B$ be constants. If $\frac{3x+5}{(x+1)(2x+3)}$\n\n$\equiv\frac A{x+1}+\frac B{2x+3}$, find $A,B$.',r'設 $A,B$ 為常數。若 $\frac{3x+5}{(x+1)(2x+3)}$\n\n$\equiv\frac A{x+1}+\frac B{2x+3}$，求 $A,B$。',r'Clearing denominators for $x\ne-1,-\frac32$ gives the polynomial identity $3x+5=A(2x+3)+B(x+1)$. Set $x=-1$ to get $A=2$; set $x=-\frac32$ to get $B=-1$. Check: $2(2x+3)-(x+1)=3x+5$.',r'在 $x\ne-1,-\frac32$ 下同乘分母得多項式恆等式 $3x+5=A(2x+3)+B(x+1)$。代入 $-1$ 得 $A=2$，代入 $-\frac32$ 得 $B=-1$。檢查：$2(2x+3)-(x+1)=3x+5$。','poly-partial-fractions','rational-expressions','medium','Clear denominators, evaluate the resulting polynomial identity at two roots and verify coefficients.',page=2)
verify(13,2*(2*x+3)-(x+1),3*x+5,'partial fractions numerator identity')
f14=3*x**3-19*x*x+16*x+24;verify(14,f14.subs(x,-s.Rational(2,3)),s.Integer(4),'remainder');verify(14,f14-4,(3*x+2)*(x-2)*(x-5),'factorisation');verify(14,(f14-4)/(9*x**3-12*x*x-12*x),(x-5)/(3*x),'rational cancellation')
add(14,r'Let $f(x)=3x^3-19x^2+16x+24$.'+'\n\n'+r'(a) Find the remainder when $f(x)$ is divided by $3x+2$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) Hence factorise $3x^3-19x^2+16x+20$.'+'\n\n'+r'(c) Simplify $\frac{3x^3-19x^2+16x+20}{9x^3-12x^2-12x}$.',r'設 $f(x)=3x^3-19x^2+16x+24$。'+'\n\n'+r'(a) 求 $f(x)$ 被 $3x+2$ 除時的餘式。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 由此因式分解 $3x^3-19x^2+16x+20$。'+'\n\n'+r'(c) 化簡 $\frac{3x^3-19x^2+16x+20}{9x^3-12x^2-12x}$。',r'(a) By the remainder theorem, the remainder is $f(-\frac23)=4$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) The expression is $f(x)-4$, so it has factor $3x+2$. Division gives $x^2-7x+10=(x-2)(x-5)$. Thus it factors as $(3x+2)(x-2)(x-5)$.'+'\n\n'+r'(c) The denominator is $3x(3x+2)(x-2)$. Cancel common factors to obtain $(x-5)/(3x)$, retaining $x\ne0,-\frac23,2$.',r'(a) 由餘式定理，餘式為 $f(-\frac23)=4$。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 該式為 $f(x)-4$，所以有因式 $3x+2$；相除得 $x^2-7x+10=(x-2)(x-5)$，故分解為 $(3x+2)(x-2)(x-5)$。'+'\n\n'+r'(c) 分母為 $3x(3x+2)(x-2)$，約去共同因式後得 $(x-5)/(3x)$，保留 $x\ne0,-\frac23,2$。','poly-rational-products','rational-expressions','hard','Use a remainder to create a factor, factorise both cubic expressions and preserve exclusions after cancellation.',page=2)
f15=x**3-5*x*x-2*x+24;g15=x**3-6*x*x-25*x-18
verify(15,f15,(x+2)*(x-3)*(x-4),'f factorisation');verify(15,g15,(x+1)*(x+2)*(x-9),'g factorisation');verify(15,f15/g15-3/(x-9),(x-1)/(x+1),'final rational simplification')
add(15,r'Let $f(x)=x^3-ax^2-2x+4b$ and $g(x)=x^3-bx^2-5ax-18$, where $a,b$ are constants.'+'\n\n'+r'When $f(x)$ is divided by $x+1$, the remainder is20. Also $g(x)$ is divisible by $x+1$.'+'\n\n'+r'(a) Find $a,b$. (b) Factorise $f(x),g(x)$.'+'\n\n'+r'(c) Simplify $\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}-\frac3{x-9}$.',r'設 $f(x)=x^3-ax^2-2x+4b$ 及 $g(x)=x^3-bx^2-5ax-18$，其中 $a,b$ 為常數。'+'\n\n'+r'$f(x)$ 被 $x+1$ 除時餘式為20，而 $g(x)$ 可被 $x+1$ 整除。'+'\n\n'+r'(a) 求 $a,b$。(b) 因式分解 $f(x),g(x)$。'+'\n\n'+r'(c) 化簡 $\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}-\frac3{x-9}$。',r'(a) The conditions give $1-a+4b=20$ and $-19-b+5a=0$. Solving $-a+4b=19$, $5a-b=19$ gives $a=5,b=6$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) Substitute and factor: $f(x)=(x+2)(x-3)(x-4)$; $g(x)=(x+1)(x+2)(x-9)$.'+'\n\n'+r'(c) Cancel $x+2$, retaining its original exclusion. The common numerator is $(x-3)(x-4)-3(x+1)$, which equals $x^2-10x+9=(x-1)(x-9)$. The result is $(x-1)/(x+1)$, with $x\ne-1,-2,9$.',r'(a) 條件給 $1-a+4b=20$、$-19-b+5a=0$，聯立 $-a+4b=19$、$5a-b=19$ 得 $a=5,b=6$。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 代入並分解得 $f(x)=(x+2)(x-3)(x-4)$、$g(x)=(x+1)(x+2)(x-9)$。'+'\n\n'+r'(c) 約去 $x+2$，但保留原本排除的值。通分後分子為 $(x-3)(x-4)-3(x+1)$，即 $x^2-10x+9=(x-1)(x-9)$。結果為 $(x-1)/(x+1)$，其中 $x\ne-1,-2,9$。','poly-rational-sums','rational-expressions','hard','Solve linked remainder conditions, factor two cubics, combine fractions and retain all cancelled domain exclusions.',page=2)
finish('rational-review')

begin('694fe8baac70e10e')
f1=6*x**3-23*x*x+25*x-6;g1=3*x*x-7*x+2
verify(1,f1,(x-2)*(6*x*x-11*x+3),'coefficient comparison');verify(1,f1-g1,2*(x-2)**2*(3*x-1),'difference factorisation')
add(1,r'Let $f(x)=6x^3+kx^2-(k-2)x-6$, where $k$ is a constant. It is given that $f(x)=(x-2)(ax^2+bx+c)$, where $a,b,c$ are constants.'+'\n\n'+r'(a) Find $a,b,c$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) Let $g(x)=3x^2-7x+2$. Someone claims that $f(x)=g(x)$ has3 distinct real roots. Do you agree? Explain.',r'設 $f(x)=6x^3+kx^2-(k-2)x-6$，其中 $k$ 為常數。已知 $f(x)=(x-2)(ax^2+bx+c)$，其中 $a,b,c$ 為常數。'+'\n\n'+r'(a) 求 $a,b,c$。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 設 $g(x)=3x^2-7x+2$。有人聲稱 $f(x)=g(x)$ 有3個相異實根。你是否同意？解釋。',r'(a) Expansion gives coefficients $a=6$, $b-2a=k$, $c-2b=2-k$, $-2c=-6$. Hence $c=3$, $b=k+12$, and $3-2(k+12)=2-k$, so $k=-23$ and $b=-11$. Thus $a=6,b=-11,c=3$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) Subtract $g$ to get $f-g=6x^3-26x^2+32x-8$.'+'\n\n'+r'$f-g=2(x-2)^2(3x-1)$.'+'\n\n'+r'The distinct real roots are $2$ and $1/3$ only;2 is repeated. Disagree. The factor2 is retained; it does not change the zero set.',r'(a) 展開及比較係數得 $a=6$、$b-2a=k$、$c-2b=2-k$、$-2c=-6$。故 $c=3$、$b=k+12$，由 $3-2(k+12)=2-k$ 得 $k=-23$、$b=-11$，所以 $a=6,b=-11,c=3$。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 相減得 $f-g=6x^3-26x^2+32x-8$。'+'\n\n'+r'$f-g=2(x-2)^2(3x-1)$。'+'\n\n'+r'相異實根只有2及 $1/3$，其中2是重根，因此不同意。保留因式2；它不影響零點。','poly-root-nature','polynomial-equations','hard','Compare linked parameter coefficients, factor a polynomial difference and distinguish multiplicity from distinct-root count.')
p2=(2*x+1)*(x*x-x-1);verify(2,s.rem(p2,x*x-x-2,x),2*x+1,'quadratic remainder');verify(2,p2.subs(x,-1),s.Integer(-1),'first source remainder');verify(2,p2.subs(x,2),s.Integer(5),'second source remainder')
q=add(2,r'Let $p(x)$ be cubic. Its remainders on division by $x+1$ and $x-2$ are $-1$ and5 respectively.'+'\n\n'+r'(a) Find the remainder when divided by $x^2-x-2$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) The quotient and remainder are the same when $p(x)$ is divided by $x^2-x-2$. Someone claims $p(x)=0$ has two rational roots. Do you agree? Explain.',r'設 $p(x)$ 為三次多項式，被 $x+1$ 及 $x-2$ 除時的餘式分別為 $-1$ 及5。'+'\n\n'+r'(a) 求它被 $x^2-x-2$ 除時的餘式。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 已知 $p(x)$ 被 $x^2-x-2$ 除時的商式與餘式相同。有人聲稱 $p(x)=0$ 有兩個有理根。你是否同意？解釋。',r'(a) Write the remainder as $Ax+B$. At the divisor roots, $-A+B=-1$ and $2A+B=5$. Thus $A=2,B=1$, giving remainder $2x+1$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) The quotient is also $2x+1$. Hence $p(x)=(2x+1)(x^2-x-2)+(2x+1)$.'+'\n\n'+r'$p(x)=(2x+1)(x^2-x-1)$.'+'\n\n'+r'The roots are $-1/2$ and $(1\pm\sqrt5)/2$. Exactly one is rational, so disagree with the claim of two rational roots. The source last sentence says agree, contradicting its own root list; the original question is retained and that answer-key error is corrected.',r'(a) 設餘式為 $Ax+B$。代入除式的根得 $-A+B=-1$、$2A+B=5$，故 $A=2,B=1$，餘式為 $2x+1$。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 商式亦為 $2x+1$，所以 $p(x)=(2x+1)(x^2-x-2)+(2x+1)$。'+'\n\n'+r'$p(x)=(2x+1)(x^2-x-1)$。'+'\n\n'+r'各根為 $-1/2$ 及 $(1\pm\sqrt5)/2$，恰有一個有理根，所以不同意「有兩個有理根」。來源解答最後寫「同意」，但與其列出的根矛盾；此處保留原題並修正答案誤植。','poly-root-nature','polynomial-equations','hard','Recover a linear remainder at two roots, use equal quotient/remainder and distinguish irrational from rational roots.')
q['adaptation']={'en':'Source conclusion says agree although its own computed roots contain only one rational root. Independent factorisation confirms disagree; original question unchanged.','zh-Hant':'來源結論誤寫同意，但其列出的根只有一個有理根；獨立分解確認應不同意，保留原題。'}
f3=(x+2)*(3*x-1)**2
verify(3,s.rem(f3,x*x-4,x),25*x+50,'quadratic remainder');verify(3,f3.subs(x,1),s.Integer(12),'linear remainder');verify(3,f3.subs(x,s.Rational(1,3)),s.Integer(0),'known factor')
add(3,r'The cubic $f(x)$ is divisible by $x+2$. When divided by $x^2-4$, its remainder is $25x+k$, where $k$ is a constant.'+'\n\n'+r'(a) Find $k$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) Also $3x-1$ is a factor, and division by $x-1$ gives remainder12. Someone claims $f(x)=0$ has three distinct real solutions. Is this correct? Explain.',r'三次多項式 $f(x)$ 可被 $x+2$ 整除，被 $x^2-4$ 除時餘式為 $25x+k$，其中 $k$ 為常數。'+'\n\n'+r'(a) 求 $k$。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 又知 $3x-1$ 是因式，而被 $x-1$ 除時餘式為12。有人聲稱 $f(x)=0$ 有三個相異實數解。聲稱是否正確？解釋。',r'(a) Put $f(x)=(Ax+B)(x^2-4)+25x+k$. At $x=-2$, $0=-50+k$, so $k=50$.'+'\n\n'+r'(b) At $x=1/3$, the factor condition gives $A/3+B=15$. At $x=1$, $f(1)=12$ gives $A+B=21$. Thus $A=9,B=12$.'+'\n\n'+r'$f(x)=9x^3+12x^2-11x+2$.'+'\n\n'+r'$f(x)=(x+2)(3x-1)^2$.'+'\n\n'+r'The distinct real solutions are $-2$ and $1/3$; the latter is repeated. The claim is incorrect.',r'(a) 設 $f(x)=(Ax+B)(x^2-4)+25x+k$。代入 $x=-2$ 得 $0=-50+k$，故 $k=50$。'+'\n\n'+r'(b) 代入 $1/3$，由因式條件得 $A/3+B=15$；代入1，由 $f(1)=12$ 得 $A+B=21$，聯立得 $A=9,B=12$。'+'\n\n'+r'$f(x)=9x^3+12x^2-11x+2$。'+'\n\n'+r'$f(x)=(x+2)(3x-1)^2$。'+'\n\n'+r'相異實數解只有 $-2$ 及 $1/3$，後者是重根，故聲稱不正確。','poly-root-nature','polynomial-equations','hard','Use a known divisor root to fix the remainder, solve quotient coefficients and count distinct repeated roots.')
finish('cubic-revise')
